# Day 11 — Task Domain

```markdown
# NEXUS — Day 11 Engineering Log

## Objective

Transform tasks from simple database records into a proper domain model.

## Task Domain

A task represents an actionable unit of work.

Core properties include:

- Identity
- Ownership
- Title
- Description
- Status
- Priority
- Deadline
- Estimated effort
- Parent task
- Project relationship
- Goal relationship

## Domain Rules

Examples:

```text
Completed task cannot return to active state without explicit transition.

Task must belong to the authenticated user.

Parent-child relationships must be valid.

Invalid task transitions must be rejected.


